<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: questDescription->[asker_nameFull], [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], asks for urgent help. [angreiferFaction_pawnsPlural] of [angreiferFaction_name] are storming one of [asker_possessive] settlements. The walls are breached and parts of it are burning. The defenders are still holding out, but they will not last long on their own.\n\nHelp them drive off the attackers. If the defenders fall before the attackers are beaten, the settlement is lost. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription-&gt;[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]緊急求援。[angreiferFaction_name]的[angreiferFaction_pawnsPlural]正在猛攻[asker_possessive]一處據點。城牆已被攻破，部分區域陷入火海。守軍還在撐，但光靠他們撐不了多久。\n\n幫助他們擊退來犯者。若守軍在敵人被擊敗前倒下，據點就會失守。</li>
  </CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: questName->The Siege of [asker_nameDef]'s [place] || questName->[place] under Attack || questName->Relief for [asker_nameDef] || place->Village || place->Settlement || place->Town -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questName-&gt;[asker_nameDef]的[place]圍城戰</li>
    <li>questName-&gt;遭受攻擊的[place]</li>
    <li>questName-&gt;馳援[asker_nameDef]</li>
    <li>place-&gt;村莊</li>
    <li>place-&gt;據點</li>
    <li>place-&gt;城鎮</li>
  </CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.questNameRules.rulesStrings>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.15.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>任務失敗：[resolvedQuestName]</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.15.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: We did not arrive in time. The settlement has fallen to the attackers. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has failed. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.15.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>我們沒能及時趕到。據點已落入來犯者手中。任務「[resolvedQuestName]」失敗了。</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.15.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.16.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>任務失敗：[resolvedQuestName]</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.16.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The last defenders have fallen. The settlement is lost. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has failed. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.16.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>最後的守軍倒下了。據點已經失守。任務「[resolvedQuestName]」失敗了。</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.16.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Quest failed: [resolvedQuestName] -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.17.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>任務失敗：[resolvedQuestName]</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.17.node.nodes.0.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: We left the settlement while the attackers were still there. The quest [resolvedQuestName] has ended. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.17.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>來犯者還在時我們就離開了據點。任務「[resolvedQuestName]」已結束。</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.17.node.nodes.0.text.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: Payment arrived -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.customLetterLabel.slateRef>報酬已送達</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.customLetterLabel.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: The attackers are beaten and the settlement is saved.\n\nThe payment from [asker_faction_name] has arrived. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.customLetterText.slateRef>來犯者已被擊退，據點保住了。\n\n[asker_faction_name]的報酬已經送達。</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.customLetterText.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>[asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.label.slateRef>
  <!-- EN: These colonists took part in the fight for [resolvedQuestName]. [asker_definite] wants to know who should receive the [royalFavorReward_amount] [asker_faction_royalFavorLabel] for this service. -->
  <CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>這些殖民者參與了「[resolvedQuestName]」的戰鬥。[asker_definite]想知道這次效力的[royalFavorReward_amount][asker_faction_royalFavorLabel]該給誰。</CBF_MO_Quest_ContestedSite.root.nodes.18.node.nodeIfChosenPawnSignalUsed.text.slateRef>
</LanguageData>
